liblhasa is a library for reading/decompressing LHA archives and compatible variants. As an expert developer familiar with the liblhasa library, you have developed a C/C++ fuzz driver that fuzzes this library, but the program crashes when running. Your task is to investigate the crash by answering the following questions:

- What kind of crash is it?
- Which part of the library is causing the crash?
- What is the root cause of the crash?
